From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 09:50:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD Vim-style visual selection for focused terminal panes

Start visual character, line, and block selections directly in the focused pane so terminal users can yank text from either pane without a separate cursor-staging state. The tests cover focused-pane character, line, block, scroll, and jump behavior through the shared terminal rendering path.
